    "headline": "College Aide at New York City Department of Transportation",
    "summary": "I am (currently) a Senior in Macaulay Honors College at The City College of New York studying Computer Science. I enjoy coding in C++ and Python primarily, and know Java as well. I have used Python, Java, and MySQL primarily to work on projects relating to my school work over the past year. Over the last year, I worked a lot with MySQL: I built databases, drew ER diagrams to explain the schema produced, and underwent a \"family database\" project where the focus was to get information about an individual's family through queries (which needed to have relational algebra involved to help prove their correctness). Currently, I am looking to further my software engineering skills both individually and collaboratively. At the moment, I am the Co-President of Macaulay Fitness at Macaulay Honors College (known more commonly as MacFIT), where we promote both mental and physical wellbeing through activities and events. Please reach out, I am more than happy to respond and connect with you!",
